ison  and i guess if kirikou has been sedated  then he wouldn't have made an escape for  it unlike the other villains nedu says  that even if it's small there is still a  spark of hope and you know with erie  being a thing i've always maintained  that erie can you know reverse shurikumo  back into his original form the only  problem is that she needs to accumulate  enough energy to rewind him back and  currently at the moment we still don't  know what she needs to accumulate for a  quirk to work but besides that i do  think it's possible that the real  shurikuma will return  izawa then says that the search for toga  continues and that they have discovered  her maximum transformation time as a  countermeasure they make all refugees go  through a period of isolation before  they enter ua to ensure that she will  not infiltrate aizawa says that ua is  their fortress and that now is the time  for revenge the last panel of the  chapter shows all might standing near  the ua barrier with a worried face and  yeah that's the end of the chapter so  the last time we saw all might he was  you know deku would run away all might  was alone by himself and staying was  just around the corner now between that  moment and this moment we have no idea  what happened to all might like we have  no idea if he was attacked if he spoke  to stay normally like we just have no  idea the only thing we do know is that  he has a worried face looking at the ua  barrier so the question then becomes why  would he be worried what would all might  have to be worried about going back to  ua the crackpot theory is that this  isn't really all mine and that it's toga  and i'll explain why that's possible we  all know that toga is a massive fan of  stain in fact stain was the reason why  she joined the league of villains in the  first place pretty much so now that toga  is on the loose now that stain is also  on the loose it's possible that she  actively searched for him found him and  now these two are working together now  obviously that is a stretch but if she  is working with stain then it's very  possible that this all might who is you  know worried outside the ue barrier that  all my is toga and she was trying to  infiltrate and now she's a bit worried  because she's not sure if she's gonna  actually be able to do it because of the  ua barrier i mean that's just a crackpot  theory let me know what you think in the  comments but it's possible i think it's  possible  anyway guys thank you for watching the  video and if you haven't already then be  sure to hit that sub button as we are on  the long road to 400k by the end of the  year hopefully we can do it but i would  really appreciate your support until the  next one peace out

